"we hope you’re happy with eventyay as your event’s CfP system.\n"
"These links may be helpful in the coming days and weeks:\n"
"\n"
"- Your event’s dashboard: {event_dashboard}\n"
"- A list of proposals: {event_submissions}\n"
"- Your schedule editor: {event_schedule}\n"
"\n"
"If there is anything you’re missing, please contact us via our website on "
"eventyay.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sveiki,\n"
"\n"
"ceram, ka esat apmierināti ar eventyay kā jūsu pasākuma CfP sistēmu.\n"
"Šīs saites var noderēt tuvākajās dienās un nedēļās:\n"
"\n"
"- Jūsu pasākuma informācijas panelis: {event_dashboard}\n"
"- Priekšlikumu saraksts: {event_submissions}\n"
"- Jūsu programmas redaktors: {event_schedule}\n"
"\n"
"Ja jums kaut kas pietrūkst, lūdzu, sazinieties ar mums mūsu vietnē "
"eventyay.com.\n"

#: eventyay/base/models/settings.py:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"just writing you to let you know that your Call for Participation is now\n"
"closed. Here is a list of links that should be useful in the next days:\n"
"\n"
"- You’ll find a list of all your {submission_count} proposals here:\n"
"  {event_submissions}\n"
"- You can add reviewers here:\n"
"  {event_team}\n"
"- You can review proposals here:\n"
"  {event_review}\n"
"- And create your schedule here, once you have accepted proposals:\n"
"  {event_schedule}\n"
msgstr ""
"Sveiki,\n"
"\n"
"rakstu, lai informētu, ka jūsu Call for Participation tagad ir\n"
"slēgts. Šeit ir saraksts ar saitēm, kas var noderēt tuvākajās dienās:\n"
"\n"
"- Visu jūsu {submission_count} priekšlikumu sarakstu atradīsiet šeit:\n"
"  {event_submissions}\n"
"- Recenzentus varat pievienot šeit:\n"
"  {event_team}\n"
"- Priekšlikumus varat vērtēt šeit:\n"
"  {event_review}\n"
"- Un izveidot programmu šeit, kad būsiet apstiprinājuši priekšlikumus:\n"
"  {event_schedule}\n"

#: eventyay/base/models/settings.py:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"congratulations, your event is over! Hopefully it went well. Here are some\n"
"statistics you might find interesting:\n"
"\n"
"- You had {submission_count} proposals,\n"
"- Of which you selected {talk_count} sessions.\n"
"- The reviewers wrote {review_count} reviews.\n"
"- You released {schedule_count} schedules in total.\n"
"- Over the course of the event, you sent {mail_count} mails.\n"
"\n"
"If there is anything you’re missing, please contact us via our website on "
"eventyay.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sveiki,\n"
"\n"
"apsveicam, jūsu pasākums ir beidzies! Cerams, ka viss noritēja labi. Šeit ir "
"daži\n"
"statistikas dati, kas jums varētu šķist interesanti:\n"
"\n"
"- Jums bija {submission_count} priekšlikumi,\n"
"- no kuriem izvēlējāties {talk_count} sesijas.\n"
"- Recenzenti uzrakstīja {review_count} atsauksmes.\n"
"- Kopumā publicējāt {schedule_count} programmas.\n"
"- Pasākuma laikā jūs nosūtījāt {mail_count} e-pastus.\n"
"\n"
"Ja jums kaut kas pietrūkst, lūdzu, sazinieties ar mums mūsu vietnē "
"eventyay.com.\n"

