#: eventyay/control/forms/global_settings.py:886
msgid ""
"During the update check, eventyay will report an anonymous, unique "
"installation ID, the current version of the system and your installed "
"plugins and the number of active and inactive events in your installation to "
"servers operated by the eventyay developers. We will only store anonymous "
"data, never any IP addresses and we will not know who you are or where to "
"find your instance. You can disable this behavior here at any time."
msgstr ""
"Atjauninājumu pārbaudes laikā eventyay nosūtīs anonīmu, unikālu instalācijas "
"ID, sistēmas pašreizējo versiju, jūsu instalētos spraudņus un aktīvo un "
"neaktīvo pasākumu skaitu jūsu instalācijā uz serveriem, ko pārvalda eventyay "
"izstrādātāji. Mēs glabāsim tikai anonīmus datus, nekad IP adreses, un mēs "
"nezināsim, kas jūs esat vai kur atrast jūsu instanci. Jūs jebkurā laikā "
"varat atspējot šo darbību šeit."

#: eventyay/control/forms/global_settings.py:895
msgid "E-mail notifications"
msgstr "E-pasta paziņojumi"

#: eventyay/control/forms/global_settings.py:897
msgid ""
"We will notify you at this address if we detect that a new update is "
"available. This address will not be transmitted to eventyay.com, the emails "
"will be sent by this server locally."
msgstr ""
"Mēs paziņosim jums uz šo adresi, ja konstatēsim, ka pieejams jauns "
"atjauninājums. Šī adrese netiks nosūtīta uz eventyay.com, e-pasti tiks "
"nosūtīti lokāli no šī servera."

#: eventyay/control/forms/global_settings.py:906
